WEBVTT

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.670
Chara-su!

00:00:02.670 --> 00:00:05.570
Is everyone shugo-peppy again today?

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:08.750
We're going to start a
new segment today!

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:10.960
Let's start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.490
Everyone's Hearts:

00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:13.620
Unlock!

00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:23.120
My heart: Unlock!

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.350
Open up my heart!

00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:30.490
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:00:30.490 --> 00:00:33.920
We're going on forever!

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.190
There's nothing to fear!

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:45.300
Lately it feels like things have changed a bit...

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:51.500
And it's, well, kind of nice, you know?

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:55.690
Doesn't matter who you are, if you don't give up,

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:58.720
you'll fly farther than you did today.

00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:02.840
Even if you cry a bunch, and get depressed,

00:01:02.840 --> 00:01:05.660
the morning will still come! So!

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.910
Negative heart: Lock on!

00:01:08.910 --> 00:01:12.800
You'll find the courage!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.050
Hold your head high, going on!

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.780
Continue on to tomorrow!

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:22.970
Your heart: Unlock!

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:26.850
Open up your heart!

00:01:26.850 --> 00:01:30.020
Face straight ahead, going on!

00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:33.580
We're going on forever!

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:37.660
There's nothing to fear!

00:01:47.280 --> 00:01:49.650
Shugo Chara Pucchi Pucchi!

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:52.990
"Miki's Laboratory - Part 3!"

00:01:57.150 --> 00:02:01.940
I am the brilliant scientist who can
create anything! Professor Miki!

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:03.430
And I'm her assistant, Ran!

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:04.640
I'm also her assistant, Su!

00:02:05.530 --> 00:02:08.280
Welcome to my Laboratory!

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:10.900
So, without delay, let me show
you today's invention.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.570
It's this! The Shugo Chara
Remote Control!

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:14.990
Shugo Chara...

00:02:14.990 --> 00:02:15.990
...Remote Control?

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.380
Plus...

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.240
Here's the test subject!

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:25.320
What the heck is this-nya?

00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:28.610
Yoru-kun, you are now
essentially a robot.

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:29.920
A Shugo Chara Robot...

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.210
In short, a-

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.340
Shugo-robo, right?

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:35.830
Or even shorter, a Shubo!

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.490
Ooh, I like the sound of that.

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.090
Stop taking my lines!

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.690
Now let us start the experiment.

00:02:42.690 --> 00:02:44.300
As if-nya.

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:45.000
I'm goin' home-nya.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:46.940
Switch On.

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:49.110
Exactly as planned.

00:02:52.490 --> 00:02:55.690
Now, you will throw it into
that trash can for me.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:57.840
Why are you doing this?

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.750
All in the name of scientific progress!

00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:01.540
Shugo-robo, activate!

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.830
I'm dizzy-nya!

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.070
Stop it-nya!

00:03:15.070 --> 00:03:17.790
The Professor isn't very good
at using the remote, is she?

00:03:18.410 --> 00:03:19.820
I didn't account for this.

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:22.400
Perhaps the test subject was at fault.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.540
Could be...

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.390
Don't give up-nya!

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:29.810
We'll make it a success,
and show them all!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.760
T-That's right...

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:33.230
All right! Do it!

00:03:33.530 --> 00:03:34.800
Right, left!

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:36.860
Right, left!

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:38.180
Right, left!

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:39.910
Right, left!

00:03:40.440 --> 00:03:41.750
Right, left!

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:45.570
Okay, starting the experiment!

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.340
This time it'll be a success-nya!

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:48.870
Switch On.

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:00.520
Impressive, Professor.

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:01.930
We did it-nya!

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:03.780
The Shugo-robo is a success!

00:04:03.780 --> 00:04:06.270
It'd be a lot faster to throw
it away normally, though.

00:04:06.270 --> 00:04:07.870
No kidding.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:12.930
See you again!

00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:16.280
We're starting a new segment today!

00:04:16.280 --> 00:04:18.980
Diamond's going to do
some work by herself!

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:19.680
Right!

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:23.040
In order for all you people watching
to get some awesome presents,

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:26.700
she'll be visiting lots of places
that create Shugo Chara!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:29.030
Right! I did my best!

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.210
Please, have a look!

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:35.420
Amulet Diamond's On the Scene!

00:04:36.190 --> 00:04:39.200
Today I'll be going to the editing
department at Nakayoshi!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:45.400
Diamond's on the scene at Kodansha,
where Nakayoshi's editing department is located!

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:48.020
Will she be okay by herself?

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:57.320
Nakayoshi is the magazine where the
Shugo Chara manga is serialized.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:05:02.080
The editing department has a ton of Shugo
Chara merchandise and posters!

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:10.410
Ooh, the people in the editing department
are having a meeting!

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.890
It's Amu-chan!

00:05:14.890 --> 00:05:18.980
It says that Nakayoshi is celebrating
its 55th anniversary this year.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:21.960
It's been around since way before
all of you were born, you know?

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:23.620
Amazing!

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:29.110
Hello! I'm Amulet Diamond, Nanami.

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:30.260
Hello!

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.040
I'm glad you could come.

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:35.560
Nakayoshi Chief Editor: Matsumoto

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:34.910
Since you're here, would you like
to see Shugo Chara's manuscript?

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:35.560
Yay!

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:37.490
Tada!

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:38.940
Wow!

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:43.280
These are real, actual, original
Shugo Chara manuscripts.

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.870
This is Dia.

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:46.240
Cute!

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:47.670
Amazing, don't you think?

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:54.240
Peach-Pit-sensei's hand drawn manuscripts...
Aren't they nice?

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:58.540
Chief Editor, please give us a present!

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.150
What would be good?

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:02.380
I know! How about a volume
of the original manga?

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:03.230
Yay!

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:05.710
It's Shugo Chara's latest volume!

00:06:05.710 --> 00:06:07.970
But only if you can answer this quiz.

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.880
Eh?!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:11.640
So, that's the deal.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:13.170
Let's do it!

00:06:13.170 --> 00:06:15.590
Okay then, here's the question
from the Editing Department.

00:06:15.590 --> 00:06:17.510
Each one of you think hard...

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:21.120
Here's the question from Nakayoshi's
Editing Department:

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:26.620
Which one of these is the correct way to
write the name of Shugo Chara's author?

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:28.310
You know this, right?

00:06:28.920 --> 00:06:30.320
Oh, I know.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:34.510
All right.

00:06:35.500 --> 00:06:36.700
I know.

00:06:37.630 --> 00:06:39.270
Time's up!

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:41.020
Hold up your answer, please.

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.600
Ready, set...

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:45.080
Everyone chose #3, I see.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.800
And the correct answer is...

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:51.720
The correct way to write the author's
name is #3, Peach-Pit.

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:54.070
Yay!

00:06:54.710 --> 00:06:56.550
We got a present!

00:06:56.550 --> 00:06:59.250
It's been signed by Peach-Pit!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:02.520
We'll tell you how to enter for the present
at the end of the program!

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:03.860
Sorry! Japan Residents Only!

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:10.890
Shugo Chara Pucchi Pucchi!

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:13.510
"Over the Rainbow?"

00:07:15.220 --> 00:07:17.120
Yippee, the sun's come out!

00:07:17.420 --> 00:07:19.330
It's stopped raining completely.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.990
What lovely weather!

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:22.650
Oh, look!

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:27.820
It's a beautiful rainbow.

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:29.020
Yes, it is.

00:07:29.020 --> 00:07:30.630
Temari-chan!

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:33.900
It would be wonderful if we could walk
on top of that rainbow, don't you think?

00:07:34.440 --> 00:07:38.470
Then, let's all climb the rainbow!

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:41.570
But that's not possible, right?

00:07:41.570 --> 00:07:46.260
Kiseki would say something like
"If it can be climbed, then I'll climb it!"

00:07:46.890 --> 00:07:48.400
Ran, you have him down!

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.070
Indeed, I do?

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:51.940
You won't know...

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:53.360
...until you try!

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:58.650
There's nothing you can't do,
if you put your mind to it.

00:07:58.650 --> 00:07:59.880
Right?

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:04.760
This steep slope is a little much for
a refined lady such as myself.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:06.790
Please, go on ahead.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:10.180
Temari-chan, we're almost to the top.

00:08:10.180 --> 00:08:11.800
Let's finish this together!

00:08:12.580 --> 00:08:13.800
Su-san!

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:26.280
We've reached the top of the rainbow!

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:28.890
Hey, that's Su and Temari!

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:31.300
So you <i>can</i> climb a rainbow...

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:35.190
What a lovely view.

00:08:35.190 --> 00:08:37.820
Wow, what a hill...

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.010
Temari-chan...

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:49.520
Stop! Somebody stop us!

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:57.300
Once more, please!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:02.240
It's a rainbow slide!

00:09:08.620 --> 00:09:11.730
It's a rainbow roller coaster!

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:19.420
Huh? Where's Su and Temari?

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.140
Let's go again!

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:22.860
Yes!

00:09:22.860 --> 00:09:24.210
Huh, what?

00:09:24.210 --> 00:09:26.710
Hey, this is dangerous!

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:31.880
It's fun!

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:33.920
See you again!

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:33.210
Yes!

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:38.010
Coming up next is Shugo
Chara Dokki Doki!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:41.770
Today's episode is "Round-and-round!
Our Spinning World!"

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:44.340
Pop Quiz: Who can do a spin
on a horizontal bar?

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:45.650
Me!

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:49.860
Some of the Guardians
can't even do one.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.960
Oh? Who?!

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:53.310
Find out next!

00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:07.140
I'm sure I can be a different person than I was yesterday

00:10:07.140 --> 00:10:11.970
with a hop, step, and a jump!

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:21.820
Since I met you I've been in a tizzy every day.

00:10:21.820 --> 00:10:27.350
Laughing, getting angry, going crazy... It's been tough!

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:32.650
Since I was able to see you, I've been excited every day.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:37.500
Even slipping and falling, I've been having fun!

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:45.480
Now that I think about it, I haven't had a chance to tell you.

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:51.290
I have something to say.

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:57.230
Thank you, I'm so grateful!

00:10:57.230 --> 00:11:03.580
I might not be saying it right, but it comes from my heart.

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:08.090
Thank you, for everything!

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:15.660
It's all thanks to you that I can be honest and say it.

00:11:41.920 --> 00:11:43.130
Hikaru-kun?

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.610
What are you doing?

00:11:45.610 --> 00:11:48.220
I'm doing research on
the horizontal bar.

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:51.600
It was imported to Japan during
the early Meiji period, I see.

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:52.830
Why?

00:11:52.830 --> 00:11:55.940
I have a test tomorrow in gym class where we
have to do a spin on the horizontal bar.

00:11:56.240 --> 00:11:58.460
I thought I should research
it before hand.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:11:59.890
And so, why?

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:03.330
Hikaru-kun, you can't do
a spin on the bar?

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:04.360
Right, I can't.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.610
I see.

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:09.880
You're researching with that?

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:12.920
Even if you do that, you won't
be able to do a spin.

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:16.290
Why do I have to do
it in the first place?

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:22.300
It is true that the horizontal bar is well suited for cultivating
one's sense of equilibrium and balance.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:27.190
However as long as I can do other methods
of training, I do not see the necessity.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:33.300
And yet, my teacher and classmates cheer me on
like "You can do it if you try" and "Go for it..."

00:12:33.300 --> 00:12:36.000
I do not understand the reason,
therefore I am researching.

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:38.570
You don't have to think
so hard about it.

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.190
Doing a spin on the bar is easy!

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.140
Right, Amu-senpai?

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:45.820
Uh... I guess so...

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:47.110
Amu-chan is...

00:12:47.110 --> 00:12:48.670
...a complete failure at any sports...

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:50.610
...that don't involve balls.

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:52.580
You can't do a spin, can you?

00:12:52.580 --> 00:12:54.000
Shut up!

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:57.040
Why don't you give it a try?

00:12:58.350 --> 00:13:02.170
You might understand why everyone
is cheering you on.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.620
Let's try, Hikaru!

00:13:08.170 --> 00:13:11.310
17 - Round-and-round!
Our Spinning World!

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.380
Training start!

00:13:10.380 --> 00:13:11.310
Desu!

00:13:11.530 --> 00:13:13.650
Me, too? But why?!

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:14.980
You can do it!

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:17.500
Spinnin'!

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:25.410
Kick off harder from the ground.

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:26.450
Like this!

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:28.890
Understand?

00:13:28.890 --> 00:13:30.490
Challenge it once more!

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.200
I can't do it at all...

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.400
Why don't you get Rikka-chan to help?

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.940
Yeah...

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:48.760
Hey, Rikka...

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:50.470
Backward spin...

00:13:50.470 --> 00:13:52.430
Leg hook spin...

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:54.930
Backwards leg-hook spin...

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:57.130
Tuck spin!

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:02.400
I think she's spinned out.

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:05.680
I don't get it.

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:08.650
There are surely other, more
effective exercises.

00:14:09.010 --> 00:14:13.090
Spins on the bar are meaningless
and unnecessary.

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:14.890
That might be true.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:20.740
When you decide that something is the way it is,
just because it's always been that way,

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:23.630
you form a shell and can
no longer move freely.

00:14:24.240 --> 00:14:26.550
I was like that, too.

00:14:26.550 --> 00:14:29.020
"I had to act like a girl."

00:14:29.020 --> 00:14:32.970
"For a boy like me, dancing
as a girl is impossible."

00:14:33.480 --> 00:14:35.780
I decided those things for myself.

00:14:37.510 --> 00:14:39.610
I also worried about those things.

00:14:40.120 --> 00:14:42.270
But I realized I was wrong.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:47.890
Why don't you try breaking out
of your own shell, Hikaru-kun?

00:14:47.890 --> 00:14:51.140
You might discover something new.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.840
Nagihiko, what did you find?

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.410
I found that I was having fun.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:00.220
Every day, all the time.

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:02.060
And I made a new friend.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:03.420
Hey, man!

00:15:05.420 --> 00:15:07.880
"The Sloth!"

00:15:08.440 --> 00:15:10.800
It's no use, I can't do it at all.

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:12.900
What? You're giving up?

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:16.100
Who cares if I can't do a spin?

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.240
It's not like a big deal or anything.

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:21.560
The heroine shouldn't say such things!

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:23.520
Amu-chan!

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.170
This feeling... It's an X Egg!

00:15:34.300 --> 00:15:35.190
Amu-chan...

00:15:35.190 --> 00:15:35.570
Right.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:38.150
My heart:

00:15:38.150 --> 00:15:39.680
My heart:

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.870
Unlock!

00:15:56.110 --> 00:15:59.130
Character Transformation:
Beat Jumper!

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:04.320
Character Transformation:
Amulet Heart!

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:10.880
Blaze Shoot!

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:13.740
Spiral Heart!

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:20.720
Rikka-chan, what is it saying?

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:26.200
It says that it started playing volleyball, but it's not any
good so it hasn't been able to play in any matches.

00:16:26.200 --> 00:16:28.110
There'll be other matches!

00:16:28.110 --> 00:16:31.380
Don't give up, and keep
practicing until then!

00:16:35.350 --> 00:16:37.230
What did it say?

00:16:38.520 --> 00:16:40.570
Um... it said...

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:48.110
"That's nice, coming from someone who said
'Who cares if I can't do a spin?'"

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:51.080
It heard me!

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:55.730
See, that's why the heroine
can't say things like that.

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:57.430
Shut up!

00:16:57.430 --> 00:17:01.340
Amu-chan is being drawn towards
negative feelings, it seems.

00:17:04.300 --> 00:17:07.890
It says "You're just like me!"

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:14.190
Fine. Ran? Undo the Character
Transformation.

00:17:14.190 --> 00:17:15.720
Uh, okay...

00:17:17.470 --> 00:17:20.700
Amu-chan, what are you
going to do? Amu-chan?

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.590
I'm going to do a spin on the bar!

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:46.420
It's no use...

00:17:57.730 --> 00:18:01.660
Amu-chan, hold your body
closer to the bar!

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:04.990
Like this, Amu-senpai!

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.350
Thanks, you two.

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.330
I'm not done yet.

00:18:32.810 --> 00:18:35.170
Go! Go! Amu-chan!

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:37.500
You can do it, you can do it, Amu-chan!

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:38.970
Just a little more!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.400
Amu-chan!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:45.000
You can do it, Senpai!

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:13.350
She did it!

00:19:13.350 --> 00:19:14.250
Amu-chan!

00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:24.640
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:28.780
Open Heart!

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:44.160
Good for you, Amu-chan.

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:48.270
That might have been my
greatest struggle...

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:02.180
You can do it, Hikaru-kun!

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.070
A little more!

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:04.870
That's it! That's it!

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:07.410
Feel the beat! One, two!

00:20:07.410 --> 00:20:10.420
Bend your elbows! Try and feel like
your belly button's hugging the bar!

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:11.500
You can do it!

00:20:11.500 --> 00:20:13.680
Go for it!

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:18.110
That's it, once more!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:23.110
There!

00:20:32.180 --> 00:20:33.110
Yay!

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:34.490
You did it!

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:35.890
Cool!

00:20:36.780 --> 00:20:38.380
How was it?

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:43.420
The world spun around.

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:46.840
That's it. I just don't get it.

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:50.660
I don't get it, but I'm going
to try spinning again.

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:55.730
I still don't get it. Once more...

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:08.150
I don't get it. Once again!

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:13.440
I'm gonna spin, too!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.440
Once more!

00:21:15.060 --> 00:21:16.420
Once more!

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:22.620
Once more!

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:27.180
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:30.740
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:32.600 --> 00:21:35.200
Which egg will be the lucky one!

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:41.200
Guardian Egg Love Fortune Telling!

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:43.710
First, for those of you who
chose Miki's egg...

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:46.710
Four Shugoluck Stars! Super Lucky!

00:21:46.710 --> 00:21:48.470
You might be asked out on a date!

00:21:48.470 --> 00:21:50.150
Head out looking your best!

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:52.210
Wearing a scarf will bring good luck!

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:54.610
Ran's egg is three Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:57.140
Someone you're interested
in might appear!

00:21:54.610 --> 00:21:57.140
Try talking to them with your
friends. Love might bloom!

00:21:57.140 --> 00:21:58.900
Dia's egg is two Shugoluck Stars.

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:01.050
Your luck is down at the moment.

00:21:58.900 --> 00:22:01.350
Confessing will have to wait for now.

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:04.720
Finally, for those of you
who chose Su's egg...

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:08.300
You get, um... one shugoluck star.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:12.160
Your friends might get in the way
of spending time with your crush.

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:15.770
Lucky Item: Textbook

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:16.410
But, friends are important too,
so don't get angry at them.

00:22:18.680 --> 00:22:20.520
We sure had fun today!

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:22.860
See you next time on
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:26.220
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:26.220 --> 00:22:28.010
Bye-bye!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:23:00.040
Now's the time to make your move.

00:23:00.040 --> 00:23:04.690
Nothing will start if you start worrying.

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:07.110
A song to your lips!

00:23:07.110 --> 00:23:10.830
Yeah! What're you waiting for?

00:23:10.830 --> 00:23:13.610
Bang on this door to the world.

00:23:13.610 --> 00:23:17.490
On whose terms?  That's right, ours!

00:23:17.490 --> 00:23:23.020
Just trying to grasp success before you,

00:23:23.020 --> 00:23:28.590
you're sure to become lost in the labyrinth.

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:35.670
Embrace the melody in your heart!

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:40.830
Try singing it, try shouting it!

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:51.640
Each time you get closer to who you want to be,
they'll be given birth:

00:23:51.640 --> 00:23:54.260
Our Songs!

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:19.890
Sorry! Japan Residents only!

00:24:01.070 --> 00:24:07.530
10 people will receive a copy of the latest
manga volume signed by Peach-Pit!

00:24:08.320 --> 00:24:11.940
Please send a completed
postcard to this address!

00:24:11.940 --> 00:24:16.230
We'll send out the merchandise to the
winners once they're announced!

00:24:16.230 --> 00:24:18.660
We're waiting for your postcards!
